#: ../../source/docs/beaglepilot.rst:9 34d9b4623468495a8a77c11394fe76a2
msgid ""
"This project is old and unmaintained, prefer `BBBMini project "
"<http://bbbmini.com/>`__"
msgstr "该项目已老旧且不再维护，建议使用 `BBBMini project <http://bbbmini.com/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/beaglepilot.rst:11 e9d576414c044cd08803e5c486818ec3
msgid ""
"The BeaglePilot Project aims to create the first Linux-based autopilot for "
"flying robots using the BeagleBone and the BeagleBone Black as the "
"\"hardware blueprint\"."
msgstr ""
"BeaglePilot 项目旨在利用 BeagleBone 和 BeagleBone Black 作为「硬件蓝图」，为飞行机器人创建首个基于 Linux"
" 的飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/beaglepilot.rst:15 b26579af03984b90818ddd83f0785673
msgid ""
"For this purpose the project will focus on integrating ArduPilot (most "
"popular autopilot) in the BeagleBone (Black). The main tasks performed will "
"be userspace drivers development, the Robot Operative System Integration "
"(ROS), web IDE exploration and security assessment."
msgstr ""
"为此，项目将专注于将 ArduPilot（最流行的飞控）集成到 "
"BeagleBone（Black）中。主要任务包括用户空间驱动开发、机器人操作系统集成（ROS）、Web IDE 探索以及安全评估。"

#: ../../source/docs/beaglepilot.rst:21 eb45b30a2b4c4604a021208b7a121298
msgid "Getting ArduPilot in the BeagleBone Black"
msgstr "在 BeagleBone Black 上获取 ArduPilot"

