" for BeagleBone Black on Linux <building-for-beaglebone-black-on-linux>`."
msgstr ""
"请参阅文章 :ref:`Building (ardupilot) for BeagleBone Black on Linux <building-"
"for-beaglebone-black-on-linux>` 中提供的说明。"

